{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_64","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented the cold high-multiply sidecar for `cores/bench`.\n\nChanged:\n- `alu.sv`: hot path now keeps RV32I plus low-half `MUL`; real `MULH*` hardware removed outside ALTOPS.\n- `mulh_unit.sv`: new iterative signedness-aware sidecar for `MULH/MULHU/MULHSU`.\n- `ex_stage.sv`: routes high-half multiplies through the sidecar using the existing EX busy protocol.\n- Tests updated/added, including pipeline forwarding coverage.\n- Wrote `cores/bench/implementation_notes.md`.\n\nVerification:\n- Verilator lint: pass.\n- `pytest -q cores/bench/test`: pass, 8 passed.\n- Formal: pass, 53 passed / 0 failed.\n- Cosim: `NRET=1 make cosim TARGET=bench`: pass, 2 ELFs tested.\n\nNote: plain `make cosim TARGET=bench` still builds with default `NRET=2` in this checkout, so it fails before simulation on missing `_1` RVFI ports. The evaluator/orchestrator path injects `NRET=1` from `core.yaml`, matching this core."}}
