{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"agent_message","text":"One small correctness wrinkle: reset should not clear storage, but it also should not allow a stray pre-reset WB write to sneak into the array while the rest of the pipeline is being cleared. I’m keeping reset only as a write inhibit, which avoids the per-bit clear mux that this hypothesis is targeting."}}
