{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"The current unit tests still assume `ALU_MUL` is a pure combinational ALU op, so part of this change will be retargeting that coverage to a new sidecar test. I’m going to add a small `mul_unit.sv`, keep ALTOPS behavior in `alu.sv`, and thread the sidecar through `ex_stage` using the same accept/done discipline as DIV and MULH."}}
