las remain here to match\ncores/bench/rtl/alu.sv:7:// riscv-formal's ALTOPS spec.\ncores/bench/rtl/alu.sv:20:`ifndef RISCV_FORMAL_ALTOPS\ncores/bench/rtl/alu.sv:27:`ifndef RISCV_FORMAL_ALTOPS\ncores/bench/rtl/alu.sv:44:      // M-extension. Under RISCV_FORMAL_ALTOPS the hardware operations\ncores/bench/rtl/alu.sv:48:      // The Verilator/cocotb/cosim builds leave ALTOPS undefined; MUL stays\ncores/bench/rtl/alu.sv:50:`ifdef RISCV_FORMAL_ALTOPS\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
