instruction in EX until the result is ready, and publish the completed result into EX/MEM.\"\n  - file: rtl/hazard_unit.sv\n    description: \"Add an EX busy input that freezes fetch/decode and prevents incomplete divide instructions from advancing or retiring.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire the EX busy signal into the global stall control without changing the top-level IO or nret=1 RVFI contract.\"\n  - file: test/test_alu.py\n    description: \"Update unit coverage so DIV/REM correctness is checked through the new divider path or a dedicated helper rather than the removed combinational ALU cases.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
