gister update mux so flush, hold, and data capture have a shallower cone.\"\n  - file: rtl/hazard_unit.sv\n    description: \"Use predecoded source-use and memory-op predicates to shrink load-use and dmem-stall equations and gate redirects with valid pipeline state.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire the predicate signals through the existing single-issue pipeline without changing the top-level interface.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
