  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Start the MDU for M-extension operations, hold EX while busy, and select the completed MDU result for EX/MEM writeback.\"\n  - file: rtl/hazard_unit.sv\n    description: \"Add an EX-stage multicycle stall input so IF/ID/IDEX are held consistently while the MDU is busy.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire the MDU busy/complete stall path between EX and the existing hazard network without changing the nret=1 top-level interface.\"\n  - file: rtl/core_pkg.sv\n    description: \"Add small helper encodings or predicates for identifying RV32M ALU ops if needed by EX and the MDU.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
