cone from the normal ALU mux\\nshould substantially improve Fmax while adding cycles only for rare RV32M\\ndivision instructions.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 25, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/alu.sv\", \"description\": \"Remove real DIV/REM arithmetic from the normal combinational ALU path while retaining RV32I operations, MUL variants, and ALTOPS substitutes.\"}, {\n…[29400 of 32472 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:6f323c0ecf3b7679]…\n8.53, \"delta_pct\": -15.37, \"vs_baseline\": 630.45, \"fmax_mhz\": 37.483, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4234021, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 3301, \"ff\": 783, \"seeds\": [35.644, 37.483, 37.483], \"perturbations\": [[0, 35.644, 28], [1, 37.483, 27], [2, 37.483, 27]], \"lutram\": 21, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_id/id_ex_w.rs1_val_0_s100\", \"slack_ns\": -23.055, \"arrival_ns\": 33.35, \"logic_cells\": 70, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu/u_hazard\", \"cpu/u_id\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 28, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-03T21:04:32.872053Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 2, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-03 hyp-20261003-003-r2s2 (regression, -15.37%): Even PC-only BTB/BHT prediction can regress when the IF PC-update path grows a combinational table read, tag check, counter test, and 32-bit target mux that CoreMark's avoided redirect bubbles do not repay.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
