l registers.\"\n  - file: test/test_reg_file.py\n    description: \"Update regfile unit coverage to check x0 reset behavior, mirrored read ports, write-first bypass, and post-write reads without requiring nonzero registers to clear on reset.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
