s and local sub-op fields alongside the existing control, keeping illegal-instruction defaults and all opcode validation unchanged.\"\n  - file: rtl/alu.sv\n    description: \"Refactor the monolithic 5-bit opcode case into independent one-hot-controlled result lanes with a shallow final select, preserving RISCV_FORMAL_ALTOPS behavior.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Select EX/MEM alu_result from the narrow lane outputs while preserving existing branch comparison, forwarding priority, M-sidecar stalls, and effective-address side lane.\"\n  - file: test/test_alu.py\n    description: \"Extend ALU/unit coverage for the lane-selected results so every RV32I operation and ALTOPS M substitute still matches the architectural result.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
