ar/RVFI lanes so the hot ALU-result cone no longer fans out through every execute consumer.\"\n  - file: test/test_execute_operand_lanes.py\n    description: \"Add focused dependency tests for ALU-to-ALU, ALU-to-branch, ALU-to-store-data, load-use replay, and M-sidecar source capture to guard the refactored operand lanes.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
