l/mul_unit.sv\n    description: \"Add a short-latency registered low-half multiplier sidecar with start, accept, busy, done, and result signals matching the existing sidecar style.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Route ALU_MUL through the new registered sidecar, hold EX only while its product is pending, and select the registered result into EX/MEM.\"\n  - file: rtl/hazard_unit.sv\n    description: \"Reuse the existing ex_busy pipeline hold semantics for the low-MUL sidecar so ordering and dmem-stall interactions remain unchanged.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire the revised execute busy/result behavior through the current single-issue pipeline without changing the nret=1 top-level interface.\"\n  - file: test/test_alu.py\n    description: \"Extend or retarget M-extension checks so low-half MUL is verified through the sidecar path along with the existing MULH/DIV coverage.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
