direct-control predictor with registered one-cycle-ahead lookup, aligned targets, 2-bit confidence, and registered EX training.\"\n  - file: rtl/if_stage.sv\n    description: \"Use the predictor's registered hit and target for PC selection, prelookup the next sequential or redirect PC, and preserve EX redirect priority.\"\n  - file: rtl/id_stage.sv\n    description: \"Latch the predicted_taken marker through decode while preserving invalid-fetch bubble and stall behavior.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Train only taken backward branches and direct JALs, suppress redirects only when the outstanding registered prediction matches the resolved target, and redirect on loop exits or stale targets.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire predictor lookup, training, one-bit metadata, and outstanding target verification through the existing single-issue core interface.\"\n  - file: test/test_ahead_direct_predictor.py\n    description: \"Cover registered lookup timing, trained backward-loop hits, loop-exit recovery, direct JAL hits, stale-target recovery, and stalls around predicted control flow.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
