dding cycles only for rare RV32M\\ndivision instructions.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 25, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/alu.sv\", \"description\": \"Remove real DIV/REM arithmetic from the normal combinational ALU path while retaining RV32I operations, MUL variants, and ALTOPS substitutes.\"}, {\n…[67004 of 70076 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:541dbb0d0bade1f1]…\n89.69, \"fmax_mhz\": 46.497, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4312007, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 3222, \"ff\": 1024, \"seeds\": [44.178, 46.497, 46.497], \"perturbations\": [[0, 44.178, 21], [1, 46.497, 20], [2, 46.497, 20]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_id/id_ex_w.rs1_val_0_s100\", \"slack_ns\": -17.636, \"arrival_ns\": 27.93, \"logic_cells\": 47, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu/u_loop_predictor\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu/u_id\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 21, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-03T21:55:41.424547Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 5, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-04 hyp-20261003-003-r5s2 (regression, -12.99%): A one-outstanding loop predictor still regresses after removing per-instruction predicted_next_pc payloads because the IF full-PC tag/target mux and EX outstanding-record compare/redirect gating remain on CoreMark's hot control path.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
